 underestimated their  franchise's strength in which rothman  replied that they have uncharted jumanji  spider-man he says we have our marvel  business which breaks into three  tranches there are the spider-man movies  and we're currently at work on two  spider-verse sequels to our  oscar-winning animated movie with lord  and miller and then he says we hope to  get working on the next spider-man movie  in which deadline then asked him with  john watts tom holland and zendaya  returning and rothman replied with that  whole group we hope side note he also  goes into a little bit of the other  project saying that then there are  movies i would call adjunct to the  spider-man universe that's craven which  we're shooting now and madame webb which  will start in the spring with sj  clarkson directing and then there are  many marvel characters that are  standalone so it looks like sony has  quite a bit of plans for their marvel  spider-man universe but obviously the  biggest takeaway here is that sony wants  to start on the next spider-man film  soon and they hope and probably expect  tom hollands and daya jacob battle on to  return but also john watts to possibly  direct the next trilogy he did a pretty  great job with the homecoming trilogy so  i'm sure people would love to have him  back and if they're going to continue  the same story that spider-man knowing  home left off with it would be great to  have him back and it looks like that  that's their plan they are going to  stick to continuing the story of  everybody forgetting who peter parker  was including mj and ned and this is  made pretty apparent since rothman says  that they want the whole group back  you're obviously not going to have them  back if you're not going to continue the  story you can't just start a new story  so for those of you who are wondering if  zendaya is going to return as mj and  jacob returning as ned it looks like  they are and i'm going to assume that at  whatever end this comes to whether  that's another three spider-man films or  just a spider-man 4 whatever it is is  going to end with mj and ned remembering  who peter parker is and hopefully  remembering everything that they went  through however this is not the only  spider-man 4 that fans want to know  about ever since spider-man no way home  brought together the three different  generations of spider-man tom holland  andrew garfield and toby maguire fans  have just been loving it and a bunch of  reports came out after the movie was  released that have been stating that  sony wants and has plans for toby  maguire spider-man and andrew garfield  spider-man possibly wanting to give us a  spider-man 4 with tobey maguire after  all sam raimi and toby mcguire were  supposed to do four spider-man films but  they only got to do three and sam raimi  and toby maguire opened up about that  and said that it was pretty hard on them  now sam raimi is back directing for  marvel of course he recently directed  doctor strange and the multiverse of  madness and now a lot of people are  wondering if he could possibly direct  the mcu spider-man now perhaps direct  the next tom holland trilogy however sam  remy says that he is not going to be  directing any tom holland spider-man  films now it's not because he doesn't  like tom holland as spider-man or he  doesn't like those films it's actually  because he loves and respects toby  maguire too much in a recent interview  with the los angeles times sam raimi  praised spider-man nowy home for opening  up the multiverse and bringing some of  his old friends into one movie he also  had really great things to say about tom  holland and the direction that those  films went he said i love spider-man and  i love tom holland in the role but if i  made a spider-man movie it would  probably have to be with toby or he'd  break my neck and i love that i love  that he started it with tobey maguire  with their three spider-man films and if  he were to come back and do spider-man  he would want that spider-man to be toby  because that's been his buddy for all  these years and it sounds like sam raimi  is actually open to returning which  would make sense because he just  directed multiverse of madness of marvel  film in fact he says he's definitely  open to coming back to direct a  spider-man 4 if marvel is up for it in  the same interview he said i don't know  if marvel would be interested in that  right now i don't know what their  thoughts are about that i haven't really  pursued that but it sounds beautiful  even if it wasn't a spider-man movie i'd  love to work with toby again in a  different role this is great news  because in all of the interviews after  spider-man no way home was released toby  maguire said that right now he's up for  anything so it looks like sam raimi and  toby maguire are both up for spider-man  4 the only thing that kind of needs to  happen now is that sony and marvel need  to green light it i personally really  hope this happens and there were a lot  of reports and a lot of talk after the  movie was released stating that this is  a big possibility and that the studios  are actually talking about it which  would make sense because spider-man no  way home was a massive success so  fingers crossed that things work out for  both spider-man 4s now for some thor  love and thunder news in case you  haven't heard there are some big reports  out there stating that the thor love and  thunder second trailer should be coming  this monday now as far as what time it  could drop i believe the first trailer  dropped at 10 a.m eastern time so if  they're planning on dropping it as the  same time that they dropped the first  trailer that's when you can expect it 10  am eastern time also this is not a final  confirmation and things could always  change but according to the website  cineworld.co.uk  the runtime for thor love and thunder is  going to be 140 minutes so 2 hours and  20 minutes long again this could always  change and 